# Semgrep ignore list from ~/repo/claude/templates/security-kit.
# A .semgrepignore replaces Semgrep's built-in list, so that list is repeated
# here first, then the kit's additions.

# Semgrep's defaults
node_modules/
build/
dist/
vendor/
.env/
.venv/
.tox/
*.min.js
.npm/
.yarn/
.semgrep
.semgrep_logs/
test/
tests/
*_test.go

# Build output Semgrep does not know about
.build/
DerivedData/

# Prose: changelogs and plans quote insecure URLs or key names in passing, not as code
CHANGELOG.md
PLAN-*.md

# Everything git already ignores
:include .gitignore
